## Highlights
1. A Janus Co nanoparticles and $\mathrm{Mo}_{2}\mathrm{C}$ decorated N-Doped hierarchical nanocarbon. 2. In-situ synthesis of heterostructures containing bifunctional active sites. 3. The Co and ${\mathsf{M O}}_{2}{\mathsf{C}}$ coupled N-doped carbon hybrid structure possess superior HER, OER and overall water splitting performance.
